-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\n(q,w,\\gamma)\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M\\leftrightarrow q\\in Q\\land w\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应第三版的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a436382200a93b34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a436382200a93b34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}$，见 [[73-df-pda-notation]]；$q,w,\\gamma$ 为候选状态、输入余词与栈词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}","display":false},{"tex":"q,w,\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Config}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\Gamma^*","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\n(q,w,\\gamma)\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M\\leftrightarrow q\\in Q\\land w\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*","display":true}],"bytes":1634,"backlinks":[{"id":"0f6dbde032017491","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}$，配置见 [[73-df-pda-configuration-notation]]；$C,C'\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M$。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-configuration-notation|pda configuration notation]]"}],"outgoing":["a436382200a93b34"]}